{"id":"78f3c497-240f-4b32-8782-1411d25a5211","revision":0,"last_node_id":11,"last_link_id":10,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,0],"size":[440,560],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["# LongCat-Video-Avatar 1.6: video, distilled\n\nA start image, a prompt and speech in; the video out, as long as the speech. **LongCat Avatar Video\n(distilled)** makes\n93-frame segments (3.7 s at 25 fps), each continuing from the last 13 frames of the one before, samples them the\nrelease's distilled way (8 steps: DMD LoRA then OPSD LoRA, euler, cfg 1) and encodes each into the mp4 as soon as it\nis decoded (NVENC when there is one), so the length costs disk, not memory.\n\n**Files**\n- diffusion_models/longcat-video-avatar/longcat_video_avatar_1.6_bf16.safetensors (or _int8_convrot, _w6a8, _w4a8)\n- loras/longcat-video-avatar/longcat_video_avatar_1.6_dmd_lora_bf16.safetensors and ..._opsd_lora_bf16.safetensors\n- text_encoders/umt5_xxl_bf16.safetensors (Wan 2.1's), vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors\n- audio_encoders/whisper_large_v3_encoder_fp16.safetensors\n\nMade with tools/convert.py from [meituan-longcat/LongCat-Video-Avatar-1.6](https://huggingface.co/meituan-longcat/LongCat-Video-Avatar-1.6).\n\n**Size**: the release picks the closest of its 480p buckets to the image's aspect, e.g. 832x480, 768x512, 480x832.\n\n**Audio**: give clean speech; the release separates vocals from music first."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# LongCat-Video-Avatar 1.6: video, distilled\n\nA start image, a prompt and speech in; the video out, as long as the speech. **LongCat Avatar Video\n(distilled)** makes\n93-frame segments (3.7 s at 25 fps), each continuing from the last 13 frames of the one before, samples them the\nrelease's distilled way (8 steps: DMD LoRA then OPSD LoRA, euler, cfg 1) and encodes each into the mp4 as soon as it\nis decoded (NVENC when there is one), so the length costs disk, not memory.\n\n**Files**\n- diffusion_models/longcat-video-avatar/longcat_video_avatar_1.6_bf16.safetensors (or _int8_convrot, _w6a8, _w4a8)\n- loras/longcat-video-avatar/longcat_video_avatar_1.6_dmd_lora_bf16.safetensors and ..._opsd_lora_bf16.safetensors\n- text_encoders/umt5_xxl_bf16.safetensors (Wan 2.1's), vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors\n- audio_encoders/whisper_large_v3_encoder_fp16.safetensors\n\nMade with tools/convert.py from [meituan-longcat/LongCat-Video-Avatar-1.6](https://huggingface.co/meituan-longcat/LongCat-Video-Avatar-1.6).\n\n**Size**: the release picks the closest of its 480p buckets to the image's aspect, e.g. 832x480, 768x512, 480x832.\n\n**Audio**: give clean speech; the release separates vocals from music first."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":2,"type":"LongCatAvatarModelLoader","pos":[490,0],"size":[223.745703125,58],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"unet_name","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[4]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"LongCatAvatarModelLoader"},"widgets_values":["longcat-video-avatar/longcat_video_avatar_1.6_bf16.safetensors"],"widgets_values_named":{"unet_name":"longcat-video-avatar/longcat_video_avatar_1.6_bf16.safetensors"}},{"id":3,"type":"CLIPLoader","pos":[490,118],"size":[210,106],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip_name","name":"clip_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"clip_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"type","name":"type","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"type"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"device","name":"device","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"device"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP","links":[1]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPLoader"},"widgets_values":["umt5_xxl_bf16.safetensors","wan","default"],"widgets_values_named":{"clip_name":"umt5_xxl_bf16.safetensors","type":"wan","device":"default"}},{"id"